msgid "ChemistryFunctor.forward evaluates one gas-phase reduced-kinetics path through advance_reaction_network, validates $C_{\\mathrm{NOx}} N_{h} = 0$, and rejects an explicit Euler candidate when dt exceeds the exact current-state positivity bound min($x_{i}$ / -$f_{i}$) over negative tendencies. The open boundary route contains unretained O/O2/OH and oxidation products. This is not a general stiff-stability, accuracy, Hamiltonian, entropy, or GENERIC proof. Dry deposition remains exclusively owned by DryDepositionAggregator, and no alternate chemistry formula branch is executable."
msgstr "ChemistryFunctor.forward 通过 advance_reaction_network 计算唯一的气相简化动力学路径，验证 $C_{\\mathrm{NOx}} N_{h} = 0$；当 dt 超过负 tendency 对应的当前状态精确正性上界 min($x_{i}$ / -$f_{i}$) 时，拒绝显式 Euler 候选。开放边界路由包含未保留的 O/O2/OH 和氧化产物。这不构成一般的刚性稳定性、精度、Hamiltonian、熵或 GENERIC 证明。干沉降仍仅由 DryDepositionAggregator 管理，不存在可执行的备用化学公式分支。"

