msgid "Stoichiometric NO-to-NO2 conversions per OH-initiated isoprene oxidation event along the high-NOx peroxy radical propagation branch (RO2 + NO -> RO + NO2 followed by RO + O2 -> carbonyl + HO2 and HO2 + NO -> OH + NO2; gamma_NO2 = 2.0)."
