msgstr "来源：文献；Seinfeld, J.H. and Pandis, S.N. (2016) Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics, 3rd ed., Wiley, Chapter 6, Eqs. (6.45)-(6.49) (two `NO -> NO2` conversions per OH-initiated hydrocarbon oxidation cycle); Jenkin, M.E. and Clemitshaw, K.C. (2000) Ozone and other secondary photochemical pollutants: chemical processes governing their formation in the planetary boundary layer, Atmos. Environ. 34, 2499-2527, doi:10.1016/S1352-2310(99)00478-1"

