msgstr "`1.47e-05; bounds=(1.44e-05, 1.5e-05)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "NO2 photolysis frequency from the solar global irradiance G (shortwave_down): linear coefficient B1 = (1.47 +- 0.03) e-5 W-1 m2 s-1 of J_NO2 = (1 + alpha) (B1 G + B2 G^2). G already carries the solar geometry and the cloud attenuation. The concave polynomial rises to its vertex G_v = B1 / (2 \\|B2\\|) = 1519 W m-2; at and above G_v the vertex value is held (monotone extension beyond the fitted curvature). Bounds are the stated 1-sigma fit errors."
msgstr "由太阳总辐照度 G（shortwave_down）确定 NO2 光解频率：J_NO2 = (1 + alpha) (B1 G + B2 G^2) 的线性系数 B1 = (1.47 +- 0.03) e-5 W-1 m2 s-1。G 已包含太阳几何和云衰减效应。凹多项式上升至顶点 G_v = B1 / (2 \\|B2\\|) = 1519 W m-2；达到或超过 G_v 后保持顶点值（在拟合曲率范围以外作单调延伸）。边界取所报告的 1-sigma 拟合误差。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Source: literature; Trebs, I., Bohn, B., Ammann, C., Rummel, U., Blumthaler, M., Konigstedt, R., Meixner, F.X., Fan, S. and Andreae, M.O. (2009) Relationship between the NO2 photolysis frequency and the solar global irradiance, Atmos. Meas. Tech. 2, 725-739, doi:10.5194/amt-2-725-2009; Eq. (1)-(2), abstract and Sect. 5: B1 = (1.47 +- 0.03) x 10-5 W-1 m2 s-1, B2 = (-4.84 +- 0.31) x 10-9 W-2 m4 s-1"
msgstr "来源：文献；Trebs, I., Bohn, B., Ammann, C., Rummel, U., Blumthaler, M., Konigstedt, R., Meixner, F.X., Fan, S. and Andreae, M.O. (2009) Relationship between the NO2 photolysis frequency and the solar global irradiance, Atmos. Meas. Tech. 2, 725-739, doi:10.5194/amt-2-725-2009; Eq. (1)-(2), abstract and Sect. 5: B1 = (1.47 +- 0.03) x 10-5 W-1 m2 s-1, B2 = (-4.84 +- 0.31) x 10-9 W-2 m4 s-1"

