msgid "`-4.84e-09; bounds=(-5.15e-09, -4.53e-09)`"
msgstr "`-4.84e-09; bounds=(-5.15e-09, -4.53e-09)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "NO2 photolysis frequency from the solar global irradiance G (shortwave_down): quadratic coefficient B2 = (-4.84 +- 0.31) e-9 W-2 m4 s-1 of J_NO2 = (1 + alpha) (B1 G + B2 G^2). G already carries the solar geometry and the cloud attenuation. The concave polynomial rises to its vertex G_v = B1 / (2 \\|B2\\|) = 1519 W m-2; at and above G_v the vertex value is held (monotone extension beyond the fitted curvature). Bounds are the stated 1-sigma fit errors."
msgstr "由太阳总辐照度 G（shortwave_down）确定 NO2 光解频率：J_NO2 = (1 + alpha) (B1 G + B2 G^2) 的二次系数 B2 = (-4.84 +- 0.31) e-9 W-2 m4 s-1。G 已包含太阳几何和云衰减效应。凹多项式上升至顶点 G_v = B1 / (2 \\|B2\\|) = 1519 W m-2；达到或超过 G_v 后保持顶点值（在拟合曲率范围以外作单调延伸）。边界取所报告的 1-sigma 拟合误差。"

