msgstr "来源：文献；MCM v3.3.1 (Master Chemical Mechanism, http://mcm.york.ac.uk; Jenkin et al. 2015, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 15, 11433-11459, doi:10.5194/acp-15-11433-2015, supplement file MCM_C5H8_subset.fac line 112): NO3 + C5H8 = NISOPO2, 3.15e-12 exp(-450/T); Atkinson et al. (2006) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume II, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 6, 3625-4055, doi:10.5194/acp-6-3625-2006; datasheet II.A3.69: k = 7.0e-13 cm3 molecule-1 s-1 at 298 K, Delta log k = +-0.2; k = 3.15e-12 exp(-450/T) over 250-390 K"

