msgstr "`atmosphere.chemistry.k_oh_no2_298`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "`1.15e-11; bounds=(1e-11, 1.2e-11)`"
msgstr "`1.15e-11; bounds=(1e-11, 1.2e-11)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "OH + NO2 (+M) -> HNO3 rate coefficient at 1 atm and T_ref = 298.15 K: the IUPAC I.A3.43 fall-off k = k0 kinf/(k0 + kinf) Fc^(1/(1 + (log10(k0/kinf)/N)^2)), N = 0.75 - 1.27 log10 Fc, evaluated at [N2] = p/(kB T) = 2.46e19 molecule cm-3."
msgstr "`OH + NO2 (+M) -> HNO3` 在 1 atm、T_ref = 298.15 K 下的速率系数：采用 IUPAC I.A3.43 的 fall-off 压力依赖形式 k = k0 kinf/(k0 + kinf) Fc^(1/(1 + (log10(k0/kinf)/N)^2))，N = 0.75 - 1.27 log10 Fc，在 [N2] = p/(kB T) = 2.46e19 molecule cm-3 处求值。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Source: literature; Atkinson et al. (2004) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume I, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 4, 1461-1738, doi:10.5194/acp-4-1461-2004; datasheet I.A3.43: k0 = 3.3e-30 (T/300)^-3.0 [N2], kinf = 4.1e-11 cm3 molecule-1 s-1, Fc = 0.4; Mollner et al. (2010) Rate of gas phase association of hydroxyl radical and nitrogen dioxide, Science 330, 646-649, doi:10.1126/science.1193030: HONO2 channel 9.2e-12 (+-0.4e-12) cm3 molecule-1 s-1 in air at 760 Torr, 25 degC"
msgstr "来源：文献；Atkinson et al. (2004) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume I, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 4, 1461-1738, doi:10.5194/acp-4-1461-2004; datasheet I.A3.43: k0 = 3.3e-30 (T/300)^-3.0 [N2], kinf = 4.1e-11 cm3 molecule-1 s-1, Fc = 0.4; Mollner et al. (2010) Rate of gas phase association of hydroxyl radical and nitrogen dioxide, Science 330, 646-649, doi:10.1126/science.1193030: HONO2 channel 9.2e-12 (+-0.4e-12) cm3 molecule-1 s-1 in air at 760 Torr, 25 degC"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "`atmosphere.chemistry.k_oh_no2_activation_energy`"
msgstr "`atmosphere.chemistry.k_oh_no2_activation_energy`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Activation energy of OH + NO2 (+M) -> HNO3 in f(T) = f(T_ref) exp(Ea/R (1/T_ref - 1/T)), T_ref = 298.15 K. Convention Ea = 0: the termolecular falloff of IUPAC I.A3.43 is not implemented and k_oh_no2_298 is held at its 1 atm, 298.15 K value. The Arrhenius form admits either sign of Ea, so the interval is unbounded."
msgstr "`OH + NO2 (+M) -> HNO3` 在 f(T) = f(T_ref) exp(Ea/R (1/T_ref - 1/T)) 中的活化能，T_ref = 298.15 K。约定 Ea = 0：未实现 IUPAC I.A3.43 的三分子 fall-off 压力依赖形式，k_oh_no2_298 保持在 1 atm、298.15 K 下的取值。Arrhenius 形式允许 Ea 为正或负，因此该区间无界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; Atkinson et al. (2004) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume I, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 4, 1461-1738, doi:10.5194/acp-4-1461-2004; datasheet I.A3.43: k0 = 3.3e-30 (T/300)^-3.0 [N2], k_inf = 4.1e-11 cm3 molecule-1 s-1, Fc = 0.4"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；Atkinson et al. (2004) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume I, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 4, 1461-1738, doi:10.5194/acp-4-1461-2004; datasheet I.A3.43: k0 = 3.3e-30 (T/300)^-3.0 [N2], k_inf = 4.1e-11 cm3 molecule-1 s-1, Fc = 0.4"

