#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Organic peroxy radical + NO rate coefficient at the Arrhenius reference temperature (RO2 + NO -> RO + NO2, MCM v3.3.1 generic KRO2NO = 2.7e-12 exp(360/T) cm3 molecule-1 s-1, k298 = 9.0e-12 cm3 molecule-1 s-1); governs the high-NOx propagation branch of isoprene-derived peroxy radicals."
msgstr "Arrhenius 参考温度下有机过氧自由基 + NO 的速率系数（`RO2 + NO -> RO + NO2`，MCM v3.3.1 通用 KRO2NO = 2.7e-12 exp(360/T) cm3 molecule-1 s-1，k298 = 9.0e-12 cm3 molecule-1 s-1）；控制异戊二烯衍生过氧自由基的高 NOx 链传递分支。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Source: literature; Jenkin, M.E., Young, J.C. and Rickard, A.R. (2015) The MCM v3.3.1 degradation scheme for isoprene, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 15, 11433-11459, doi:10.5194/acp-15-11433-2015; generic peroxy radical rate coefficient KRO2NO = 2.7e-12 exp(360/T) cm3 molecule-1 s-1, k298 = 9.0e-12 cm3 molecule-1 s-1; Atkinson, R. et al. (2006) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume II - gas phase reactions of organic species, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 6, 3625-4055, doi:10.5194/acp-6-3625-2006 (IUPAC datasheet II.A2.10 / peroxy + NO kinetics)"
msgstr "来源：文献；Jenkin, M.E., Young, J.C. and Rickard, A.R. (2015) The MCM v3.3.1 degradation scheme for isoprene, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 15, 11433-11459, doi:10.5194/acp-15-11433-2015; generic peroxy radical rate coefficient KRO2NO = 2.7e-12 exp(360/T) cm3 molecule-1 s-1, k298 = 9.0e-12 cm3 molecule-1 s-1; Atkinson, R. et al. (2006) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume II - gas phase reactions of organic species, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 6, 3625-4055, doi:10.5194/acp-6-3625-2006 (IUPAC datasheet II.A2.10 / peroxy + NO kinetics)"

