msgid "Source: literature; Jenkin, M.E., Young, J.C. and Rickard, A.R. (2015) The MCM v3.3.1 degradation scheme for isoprene, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 15, 11433-11459, doi:10.5194/acp-15-11433-2015; KRO2NO = 2.7e-12 exp(360/T) cm3 molecule-1 s-1 (E/R = -360 K); Atkinson, R. et al. (2006) Evaluated kinetic and photochemical data for atmospheric chemistry: Volume II - gas phase reactions of organic species, Atmos. Chem. Phys. 6, 3625-4055, doi:10.5194/acp-6-3625-2006"
