#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "MCM clear-sky photolysis parameter l of J4 (NO2 -> NO + O(3P)) in J = l cos(chi)^m exp(-n sec(chi)); the ratio rho(chi) = J1/J4 = (l1/l4) cos(chi)^(m1-m4) exp(-(n1-n4) sec(chi)) converts the NO2 photolysis frequency into J(O1D) = J_NO2 rho(chi) (rho = 4.24e-3 for overhead sun)."
msgstr "J = l cos(chi)^m exp(-n sec(chi)) 中 J4（`NO2 -> NO + O(3P)`）的 MCM 晴空光解参数 l；比值 rho(chi) = J1/J4 = (l1/l4) cos(chi)^(m1-m4) exp(-(n1-n4) sec(chi)) 将 NO2 光解频率转换为 J(O1D) = J_NO2 rho(chi)（太阳天顶直射时 rho = 4.24e-3）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Source: literature; Saunders, S.M., Jenkin, M.E., Derwent, R.G. and Pilling, M.J. (2003) Protocol for the development of the Master Chemical Mechanism, MCM v3 (Part A), Atmos. Chem. Phys. 3, 161-180, doi:10.5194/acp-3-161-2003: J = l cos(chi)^m exp(-n sec(chi)); J1 O3 -> O(1D) + O2: l = 6.073e-5 s-1, m = 1.743, n = 0.474; J4 NO2 -> NO + O(3P): l = 1.165e-2 s-1, m = 0.244, n = 0.267 (clear sky); MCM v3.3.1 photolysis rates, https://mcm.york.ac.uk/MCM/rates/photolysis (same J1 and J4 parameters)"
msgstr "来源：文献；Saunders, S.M., Jenkin, M.E., Derwent, R.G. and Pilling, M.J. (2003) Protocol for the development of the Master Chemical Mechanism, MCM v3 (Part A), Atmos. Chem. Phys. 3, 161-180, doi:10.5194/acp-3-161-2003: J = l cos(chi)^m exp(-n sec(chi)); J1 `O3 -> O(1D) + O2`: l = 6.073e-5 s-1, m = 1.743, n = 0.474; J4 `NO2 -> NO + O(3P)`: l = 1.165e-2 s-1, m = 0.244, n = 0.267 (clear sky); MCM v3.3.1 photolysis rates, https://mcm.york.ac.uk/MCM/rates/photolysis (same J1 and J4 parameters)"

