#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "Air-temperature dependence of the photolysis frequencies J_NO2 and J(O1D). none (default): both are independent of air temperature; the NO2 quantum yield is 1.00 at 300-398 nm at 248 and 298 K and the NO2 cross-section temperature dependence is minimal (Warneck and Williams 2012 Tables 6.13a/b). spectral_quantum_yield: J_X(T) = J_X(T_ref) R_X(T), R_X(T) = sum_lambda sigma_X(lambda,T) phi_X(lambda,T) F(lambda) / sum_lambda sigma_X(lambda,T_ref) phi_X(lambda,T_ref) F(lambda), with the tables and the reference surface spectrum of atmosphere.chemistry.photolysis.*."
msgstr "光解频率 J_NO2 和 J(O1D) 的气温依赖。none（默认）：两者均与气温无关；在 248 和 298 K 下，300-398 nm 的 NO2 量子产率均为 1.00，且 NO2 吸收截面的温度依赖很弱（Warneck 和 Williams 2012，表 6.13a/b）。spectral_quantum_yield：J_X(T) = J_X(T_ref) R_X(T)，R_X(T) = sum_lambda sigma_X(lambda,T) phi_X(lambda,T) F(lambda) / sum_lambda sigma_X(lambda,T_ref) phi_X(lambda,T_ref) F(lambda)，采用 atmosphere.chemistry.photolysis.* 中的表格和参考地表光谱。"

