msgstr "$A = - \\nu ^{\\mathsf{T}} \\mu$；$\\mu_{i} = h_{i} ( T ) - T s_{i} ( T ) + R T \\ln ( p_{i} / \\mathrm{p0} )$；$\\sigma = A r / T \\geq 0$；$\\dot{x} = L_{h} e_{E} + M_{h} e_{S}$，其中 $L_{h} = 0$ 且 $M_{h} = ( r T / A ) \\nu \\nu ^{\\mathsf{T}} ( \\mathrm{Grmela} \\mathrm{and} \\mathrm{Ottinger} 1997 ; \\mathrm{Mielke} 2011 ; \\mathrm{Kondepudi} \\mathrm{and} \\mathrm{Prigogine} 1998 )$"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md:309
msgid "$\\dot{x} = L_{h} e_{E} + M_{h} e_{S}$, $L_{h} = 0 ( \\mathrm{zero}_{\\mathrm{field}} )$, $M_{h} = ( r T / A ) \\nu \\nu ^{\\mathsf{T}}$, absorbed reaction with $M_{h} e_{S} = N r \\mathrm{checked} \\mathrm{against} \\mathrm{the}$ declared N r, $M_{h} e_{E} = 0$"
msgstr "$\\dot{x} = L_{h} e_{E} + M_{h} e_{S}$，$L_{h} = 0 ( \\mathrm{zero}_{\\mathrm{field}} )$，$M_{h} = ( r T / A ) \\nu \\nu ^{\\mathsf{T}}$，absorbed 反应，其 $M_{h} e_{S} = N r \\mathrm{checked} \\mathrm{against} \\mathrm{the}$ 已声明的 N r，$M_{h} e_{E} = 0$"

