msgid "`N`"
msgstr "`N`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "$\\nu = ( - 1 , + 1 , - 1 , + 1 , 0 ) \\mathrm{reshaped}$ to 5 by 1; $\\mathrm{reaction}_{\\mathrm{representation}} = \\mathrm{absorbed}$, so N r is not added a second time"
msgstr "$\\nu = ( - 1 , + 1 , - 1 , + 1 , 0 ) \\mathrm{reshaped}$ 重塑为 5 乘 1；$\\mathrm{reaction}_{\\mathrm{representation}} = \\mathrm{absorbed}$，因此 N r 不会被第二次加入"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "$E = U$ and S(U, n, V) evaluated by standard_molar_properties, ideal_gas_mixture_properties, and temperature_from_internal_energy on the same autograd state graph"
msgstr "$E = U$ 与 S(U, n, V) 由 standard_molar_properties、ideal_gas_mixture_properties 和 temperature_from_internal_energy 在同一 autograd 状态图上求值"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$e_{E} = \\nabla ( E ) = ( 0 , 0 , 0 , 0 , 1 )$ and $e_{S} = \\nabla ( S ) = ( - \\mu / T , 1 / T ) \\mathrm{obtained}$ by torch.autograd.grad inside canonical_drift"
msgstr "$e_{E} = \\nabla ( E ) = ( 0 , 0 , 0 , 0 , 1 )$ 与 $e_{S} = \\nabla ( S ) = ( - \\mu / T , 1 / T ) \\mathrm{obtained}$ 由 canonical_drift 内部的 torch.autograd.grad 获得"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\Delta x = \\mathrm{d}t \\dot{x}$ with $\\dot{x} = L_{h} e_{E} + M_{h} e_{S} = \\nu r$; the actual tensor candidate x + Delta x must retain strictly positive species inventories, valid $T ( U, n )$ and ideal-mixture properties, and $A > 0$ before emission"
msgstr "$\\Delta x = \\mathrm{d}t \\dot{x}$，其中 $\\dot{x} = L_{h} e_{E} + M_{h} e_{S} = \\nu r$；实际张量候选 x + Delta x 在发出前必须保持所有物种库存严格为正，$T ( U, n )$ 有效，理想混合物性质处于合法定义域内，并满足 $A > 0$"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "forward declares $\\mathrm{stoichiometric}_{N} = \\nu \\mathrm{reshaped}$ to 5 by 1 with $\\mathrm{reaction}_{\\mathrm{representation}} = \\mathrm{absorbed} \\mathrm{in} \\mathrm{IPHSStructureSpec}$, and passes the same N, reaction rate, $C_{N}$, $C_{O}$, and affinity to advance_reaction_network with $\\mathrm{d}t = \\mathrm{None}$ for the audits only."
msgstr "forward 声明 $\\mathrm{stoichiometric}_{N} = \\nu \\mathrm{reshaped}$ 为 5 乘 1，并带有 $\\mathrm{reaction}_{\\mathrm{representation}} = \\mathrm{absorbed} \\mathrm{in} \\mathrm{IPHSStructureSpec}$；同时将相同的 N、反应速率、$C_{N}$、$C_{O}$ 与 affinity 以 $\\mathrm{d}t = \\mathrm{None}$ 传入 advance_reaction_network，仅用于审计。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md
msgid "ChemistryFunctor.forward evaluates one GENERIC absorbed-reaction path through canonical_drift, verifies $M_{h} e_{S} = N r$ to reduction roundoff, validates the bound pre-step runtime point at $\\mathrm{required}_{\\mathrm{level}} = 5$, and audits $C_{N} \\nu = 0$, $C_{O} \\nu = 0$, and $A r \\geq 0$; before publishing the audit or emitting five ACCUMULATE increments plus eight REPLACE diagnostics, the same pure thermodynamic-point owner checks the actual tensor Euler candidate for $n_{i} > 0$, valid $T ( U, n )$, and $A > 0$, without a second drift or state advance. Discrete entropy monotonicity, stiff-stability and accuracy are not certified."
msgstr "ChemistryFunctor.forward 通过 canonical_drift 计算唯一的 GENERIC absorbed-reaction 路径，在归约舍入误差范围内核验 $M_{h} e_{S} = N r$，用已绑定的步前运行点验证 $\\mathrm{required}_{\\mathrm{level}} = 5$，并审计 $C_{N} \\nu = 0$、$C_{O} \\nu = 0$ 与 $A r \\geq 0$；在发布审计或发出五个 ACCUMULATE 增量和八个 REPLACE 诊断量之前，同一纯热力学性质所有者检查实际张量 Euler 候选是否满足 $n_{i} > 0$、有效的 $T ( U, n )$ 及 $A > 0$，不另算第二个 drift 或推进状态。离散熵单调性、刚性稳定性与精度尚未认证。"

