#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md:816
msgid "The certificate interface and the FunctorMetadata of the documented constructor configuration (the union over all documented modes when there are several) are not identical for this class. The tables above report the complete certificate-backed interface, including any configuration-conditional ports. The difference is listed here so callers do not infer an unconditional interface. Input declaration difference: `leaf_area_index`. Output declaration difference: `apar_layer`, `diagnostics.radiation.transmission_diffuse`, `diagnostics.radiation.transmission_direct`, `fpar`."
msgstr "此类的证书接口与文档所述构造配置的 FunctorMetadata（存在多个模式时取所有已记录模式的并集）并不相同。上表列出由证书支持的完整接口，包括依配置而定的端口。这里列出差异，避免调用方将接口理解为无条件适用。输入声明差异：`leaf_area_index`。输出声明差异：`apar_layer`、`diagnostics.radiation.transmission_diffuse`、`diagnostics.radiation.transmission_direct`、`fpar`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/atmosphere.md:825
msgid "$R_{\\mathrm{net}} = \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{net}} + \\mathrm{LW}_{\\mathrm{net}}$; $\\mathrm{PPFD} = \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{down}} \\cdot f_{\\mathrm{PAR}} \\cdot c_{\\mathrm{PPFD}}$; $k_{T} = \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{down}} / \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{ext},h}$; Erbs $f_{\\mathrm{dif}} = 1 - 0.09 k_{T}$ for $k_{T} \\leq 0.22$, fourth-order polynomial for $0.22 < k_{T} \\leq 0.80$, and 0.165 above 0.80"
msgstr "$R_{\\mathrm{net}} = \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{net}} + \\mathrm{LW}_{\\mathrm{net}}$；$\\mathrm{PPFD} = \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{down}} \\cdot f_{\\mathrm{PAR}} \\cdot c_{\\mathrm{PPFD}}$；$k_{T} = \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{down}} / \\mathrm{SW}_{\\mathrm{ext},h}$；Erbs 的 $f_{\\mathrm{dif}} = 1 - 0.09 k_{T}$ 适用于 $k_{T} \\leq 0.22$，在 $0.22 < k_{T} \\leq 0.80$ 时使用四阶多项式，在 0.80 以上取 0.165"

